\newlabel{fig:ablation}{{7}{16}{\textbf {Feature ablation over the five archived seeds (mean $\pm $ std). Neither feature family alone matches the full 88-dimensional configuration, and the RF outperforms an SVM given identical features.}}{figure.7}{}}
